@startuml get_data_async

' Same level, asynchronous: the same call, now with the interaction of unit_2.

participant unit_1 <<unit>>
participant unit_2 <<unit>>
participant Platform <<external>>

unit_1 ->> unit_2 : GetData()
unit_2 ->> Platform : Log()
ref over unit_2 : score-window-end

@enduml
